  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation in International Waters (CIWA) - RDEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Managed by the World Bank, CIWA makes investments to develop water infrastructure and offers technical support and analyses to create a better understanding of transboundary water issues so that governments, river basin organisations, and other stakeholders can make sound, evidence-based decisions.</narrative>
  </description>
